1vis|n|The grain left after harvest or gleaning; also, nuts which have fallen to the ground. ; Liberty of winter pasturage. ; A shiftless fellow; a low, itinerant beggar; a vagabond; a tramp.	a:1p7l,132,1~1p7l,132,1	n:1p7l,132,1~1p7l,132,1
