1w3c|a|Easily frightened; timid; as, a shy bird. ; Reserved; coy; disinclined to familiar approach. ; Cautious; wary; suspicious. ; To start suddenly aside through fright or suspicion; -- said especially of horses.	e:24gy,38,3~24gy,38,3
